Notebook[{
Cell["Two Open-System Examples Built from Minimal Assumptions", "Title",
 CellID->874461601,ExpressionUUID->"22a1a762-10e3-861e-525e-3f4ca097ed64"],

Cell["\<\
A pilot for a fixed way of writing physics with its foundations exposed: \
state the questions, define the words by computation, list the assumptions, \
say what each result uses, turn each assumption off and watch what happens, \
and check the headline claim two independent ways.\
\>", "Subtitle",
 CellID->36768919,ExpressionUUID->"4da796ef-9f57-a4bf-7b5c-0fc91ae30e85"],

Cell["Mads Bahrami", "Author",
 CellID->1699946459,ExpressionUUID->"1b39f900-6440-cee7-4ac6-f16a0dfa94cd"],

Cell["Wolfram Research, Inc.", "Affiliation",
 CellID->1535504786,ExpressionUUID->"75d93363-5da6-51a4-23e6-ab4d5453238e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "This essay rebuilds two systems from the catalog essay in this folder, ",
 StyleBox["Watching Quantum Things", "TI"],
 ": a cat state in a leaky cavity, and a monitored qubit purified by choosing \
what to measure. The physics is the catalog's. What is new is the \
bookkeeping: every claim hangs off a short, named list of assumptions, and \
the list itself is tested by computation rather than asserted. Where a \
turned-off assumption is that catalog's whole topic, the text says so and \
points there instead of rebuilding it."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1208482393,ExpressionUUID->"25a568a6-87a2-527f-535a-810032572145"],

Cell["The method is six rules, applied to each example separately.", "Text",
 CellID->28909615,ExpressionUUID->"00d7f70d-8d0e-ae34-30ec-ef5724b8f51e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Rule 1.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Open with the questions the example answers, ordered so the first needs \
the fewest premises."
}], "Text",
 CellID->193832008,ExpressionUUID->"2f3e8453-9762-68ea-56c5-1e1d22173a30"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Rule 2.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Define the words before the list uses them. Every term that carries weight \
in a question or assumption gets a one-line meaning and a computation that \
answers yes or no for a concrete state, with a separating example wherever \
two terms are nested: every thermal state is Gaussian, and almost no Gaussian \
state is thermal, so an assumption saying one while needing the other is \
wrong in a way a reader cannot detect."
}], "Text",
 CellID->684317082,ExpressionUUID->"5902d484-617f-9570-0f31-cdee100bfc5a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Rule 3.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " List the assumptions, each with its scope in one line, marking facts of \
the model apart from choices of description."
}], "Text",
 CellID->528485616,ExpressionUUID->"56e0e12c-de7d-6135-7e9f-f889db08301f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Rule 4.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Every result states, in a plain sentence, which listed assumptions it uses."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1392207227,ExpressionUUID->"5708d032-2150-04f2-7d37-ca7c50e56ed8"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Rule 5.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Every listed assumption gets at least one computation that turns it off \
and shows the claim fail, change, or survive. A claim that survives costs the \
list an entry, and that is the method working, not failing: the list is \
minimal because we checked."
}], "Text",
 CellID->705466992,ExpressionUUID->"3b7807e8-9504-b25a-6907-9eb21cb600a0"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Rule 6.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " The headline claim of each part is verified along two routes that share no \
code."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1350516518,ExpressionUUID->"166f8969-5e31-e8e5-3e14-21335bc5bacf"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Rule 5 is the heart. An assumption list is cheap to write and easy to pad; \
exercising each entry is what makes it honest. Everything below is \
self-contained: run the cells top to bottom. We set ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[HBar]", "=", "1"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "234f1fb7-07c6-bba9-5174-96f1b27009f3"],
 " throughout."
}], "Text",
 CellID->907546795,ExpressionUUID->"6ee45b93-a0df-d1f6-169c-52dcd16ba3dc"],

Cell["The Shared Tools, and the Habit of Two Routes", "Section",
 CellID->814772321,ExpressionUUID->"0a3edd72-e0d3-62fb-3bc5-d53f916630c1"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Both parts use the density matrix ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6ec9a758-58be-624c-16f6-3f02594b3096"],
 " and the Lindblad master equation ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "."], "=", "-", 
   StyleBox["i", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["[",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["H", "TI"], "^"], ",", 
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"]}], 
   StyleBox["]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], "+", 
   UnderscriptBox["\[Sum]", 
    StyleBox["k", "TI"],
    LimitsPositioning->False], "\|01d49f", 
   StyleBox["[",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   SubscriptBox[
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["c", "TI"], "^"], 
    StyleBox["k", "TI"]], 
   StyleBox["]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "23253b8d-1c99-a6bf-52da-b2d7952d0c85"],
 " with the dissipator ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\|01d49f", 
   StyleBox["[",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["c", "TI"], "^"], 
   StyleBox["]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "=", 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["c", "TI"], "^"], 
   StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
   SuperscriptBox[
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["c", "TI"], "^"], "\[Dagger]"], "-", 
   FractionBox["1", "2"], 
   StyleBox["(",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["c", "TI"], "^"], "\[Dagger]"], 
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["c", "TI"], "^"], 
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "+", 
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], 
    SuperscriptBox[
     OverscriptBox[
      StyleBox["c", "TI"], "^"], "\[Dagger]"], 
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["c", "TI"], "^"]}], 
   StyleBox[")",
    SpanMaxSize->1]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6e84829b-9667-6594-16bb-1bc523124ffe"],
 ". Build the state and the two terms:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1054628905,ExpressionUUID->"569e173f-6b36-b240-7ea5-8f790ec000aa"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"densityMatrix", "[", "v_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"KroneckerProduct", "[", 
    RowBox[{"v", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Conjugate", "[", "v", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"purity", "[", "rho_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Re", "@", 
    RowBox[{"Tr", "[", 
     RowBox[{"rho", " ", ".", " ", "rho"}], "]"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"traceDistance", "[", 
    RowBox[{"a_", ",", " ", "b_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
     RowBox[{"SingularValueList", "[", 
      RowBox[{"a", " ", "-", " ", "b"}], "]"}], "]"}], "/", "2"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"dissipator", "[", 
    RowBox[{"c_", ",", " ", "rho_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"c", " ", ".", " ", "rho", " ", ".", " ", 
     RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "c", "]"}]}], " ", "-", "\n", "   ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "c", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", "c", 
        " ", ".", " ", "rho"}], " ", "+", " ", 
       RowBox[{"rho", " ", ".", " ", 
        RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "c", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", "c"}]}],
       ")"}], "/", "2"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"lindbladian", "[", 
    RowBox[{"H_", ",", " ", "leaks_List", ",", " ", "rho_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=",
    " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"-", "I"}], " ", 
     RowBox[{"(", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"H", " ", ".", " ", "rho"}], " ", "-", " ", 
       RowBox[{"rho", " ", ".", " ", "H"}]}], ")"}]}], " ", "+", " ", 
    RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"dissipator", "[", 
        RowBox[{"#", ",", " ", "rho"}], "]"}], " ", "&"}], " ", "/@", " ", 
      "leaks"}], "]"}]}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[1]:= ",
 CellID->2043779557,ExpressionUUID->"15a3e88e-0b57-fa6e-4350-01e8aee3c8b4"],

Cell["\<\
The master equation gets two independent solvers, one via the vectorized \
generator and a matrix exponential, one via a plain differential-equation \
march, sharing no code:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->17830494,ExpressionUUID->"779c57de-bb93-d239-1da4-4e983e27a103"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"liouvillian", "[", 
    RowBox[{"H_", ",", " ", "leaks_List", ",", " ", "d_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", 
   " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"id", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "d", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", "I"}], " ", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"KroneckerProduct", "[", 
          RowBox[{"H", ",", " ", "id"}], "]"}], " ", "-", " ", 
         RowBox[{"KroneckerProduct", "[", 
          RowBox[{"id", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", "H", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ")"}]}], " ", "+",
       "\n", "    ", 
      RowBox[{"Total", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Function", "[", 
         RowBox[{"c", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"KroneckerProduct", "[", 
            RowBox[{"c", ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"Conjugate", "[", "c", "]"}]}], "]"}], " ", "-", "\n", 
           "        ", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"(", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"KroneckerProduct", "[", 
               RowBox[{
                RowBox[{
                 RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "c", "]"}], " ", ".", " ",
                  "c"}], ",", " ", "id"}], "]"}], " ", "+", "\n", 
              "           ", 
              RowBox[{"KroneckerProduct", "[", 
               RowBox[{"id", ",", " ", 
                RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", 
                 RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "c", "]"}], " ", ".", 
                  " ", "c"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ")"}], "/", "2"}]}]}], "]"}], 
        " ", "/@", " ", "leaks"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"evolve", "[", 
    RowBox[{"H_", ",", " ", "leaks_List", ",", " ", "rho0_", ",", " ", "t_"}],
     "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"d", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Length", "[", "rho0", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"ArrayReshape", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"MatrixExp", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"liouvillian", "[", 
           RowBox[{"H", ",", " ", "leaks", ",", " ", "d"}], "]"}], " ", "t"}],
          "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Flatten", "[", "rho0", "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"d", ",", " ", "d"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"evolveODE", "[", 
    RowBox[{
    "H_", ",", " ", "leaks_List", ",", " ", "rho0_", ",", " ", "t1_"}], "]"}],
    " ", ":=", "\n", "  ", 
   RowBox[{"NDSolveValue", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"s", "'"}], "[", "t", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", 
        RowBox[{"lindbladian", "[", 
         RowBox[{"H", ",", " ", "leaks", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"s", "[", "t", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"s", "[", "0", "]"}], " ", "==", " ", 
        RowBox[{"N", "@", "rho0"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", "s", ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"t", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "t1"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[2]:= ",
 CellID->1589986527,ExpressionUUID->"2867ea9b-6e8d-517b-581c-03c50b382041"],

Cell["\<\
Confirm the two solvers agree on a small test system, a driven, dephased \
qubit:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->943101875,ExpressionUUID->"76dfbc62-92ac-7b6e-1ee4-364c275949b4"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"H", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "1."}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"1.", ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"c", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"0.632", ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"-", "0.632"}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"r0", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"1.", ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", "0"}], "}"}]}], "}"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", 
   " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"run", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"evolveODE", "[", 
        RowBox[{"H", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", "c", "}"}], ",", " ", "r0", ",", " ", "3."}], "]"}]}], 
      "}"}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
     RowBox[{"Max", "@", 
      RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Norm", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"evolve", "[", 
            RowBox[{"H", ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"{", "c", "}"}], ",", " ", "r0", ",", " ", "t"}], "]"}], 
           " ", "-", " ", 
           RowBox[{"run", "[", "t", "]"}]}], ",", " ", "\"\<Frobenius\>\""}], 
         "]"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"t", ",", " ", "0.", ",", " ", "3.", ",", " ", "0.5"}], 
         "}"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[3]:= ",
 CellID->1800864536,ExpressionUUID->"0df4b6a5-173c-e15a-3b8b-2f0fa2ceb3a0"],

Cell[BoxData["6.255966484903238`*^-7"], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[3]= ",
 CellID->1087140520,ExpressionUUID->"4d620fc7-5cf2-d9d8-7b11-a6a15484ab22"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
The largest disagreement sits at the solver tolerance. This is Rule 6 in its \
smallest form, and the habit repeats wherever a claim matters.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1432876021,ExpressionUUID->"741b091d-feb2-1a39-1c38-a146fb476903"],

Cell["\<\
Part One: A Cat in a Leaky Cavity, Rebuilt from Its Assumptions\
\>", "Section",
 CellID->876231958,ExpressionUUID->"3bf5a20e-c541-e06e-698a-446becf5b2b4"],

Cell["The questions, weakest premises first", "Subsection",
 CellID->1020575516,ExpressionUUID->"07964fa7-8d1e-ff14-2dae-660124a8c27e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Q1.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " What does the leak do to one coherent state? (This needs the least: one \
mode, one loss channel.)"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1967685850,ExpressionUUID->"3e367b18-9aa8-58f9-67ce-73421f5d2ac3"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Q2.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " What does the leak do to a superposition of two coherent states?"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1044562475,ExpressionUUID->"1dbaaaf7-1388-e538-4b59-43b1a622cc02"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Q3.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Which feature of the pair sets how fast the superposition's cross term \
dies, and how does that rate compare with the rate of energy loss? (This is \
the headline: the answer is the separation squared, so a mesoscopic cat \
decoheres long before it dims.)"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1653200050,ExpressionUUID->"77d99fdb-a351-2d53-1de6-1684d6e477b9"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Q4.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Which assumptions carry those answers: what changes when the bath is warm, \
when it keeps memory, when the lobes sit close, when a drive rotates them?"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1384978530,ExpressionUUID->"04646437-faee-7dfc-2c1c-7e70fe9b47c6"],

Cell["The words, defined by computation", "Subsection",
 CellID->519689844,ExpressionUUID->"1cbde497-e826-5557-4442-fdd089d33fbd"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The words that carry weight below are ",
 StyleBox["coherent state", "TI"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["Gaussian state", "TI"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["thermal state", "TI"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["well separated", "TI"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["coherence", "TI"],
 ", and ",
 StyleBox["no memory", "TI"],
 ". Each gets a definition you can run. First the objects: the truncated \
ladder operator, the coherent state, the displacement and squeeze operators, \
and the thermal state, all in a Fock basis cut at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["n", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6ecb37d0-fbcc-3e82-16c8-ae9dfe7e84e8"],
 " levels:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1609367578,ExpressionUUID->"4c358d3e-86d3-ec5f-75ca-25783367b6a5"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"annihilation", "[", "n_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"SparseArray", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Band", "[", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"1", ",", " ", "2"}], "}"}], "]"}], " ", "->", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
       RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
        RowBox[{"n", " ", "-", " ", "1"}], "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"n", ",", " ", "n"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"numberOp", "[", "n_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", 
     RowBox[{"annihilation", "[", "n", "]"}], "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
    RowBox[{"annihilation", "[", "n", "]"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"coherentState", "[", 
    RowBox[{"n_", ",", " ", "a_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"v", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Prepend", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"a", "^", "k"}], "/", 
            RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
             RowBox[{"k", "!"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{"k", ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"n", " ", "-", " ", "1"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
         "1"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"v", "/", 
      RowBox[{"Norm", "[", "v", "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"displacement", "[", 
    RowBox[{"n_", ",", " ", "b_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"MatrixExp", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"b", " ", 
      RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", 
       RowBox[{"annihilation", "[", "n", "]"}], "]"}]}], " ", "-", " ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"Conjugate", "[", "b", "]"}], " ", 
      RowBox[{"annihilation", "[", "n", "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"squeeze", "[", 
    RowBox[{"n_", ",", " ", "xi_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"a", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"annihilation", "[", "n", "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"MatrixExp", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Conjugate", "[", "xi", "]"}], " ", 
          RowBox[{"a", " ", ".", " ", "a"}]}], " ", "-", " ", 
         RowBox[{"xi", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "a", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
           RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "a", "]"}]}]}]}], ")"}], "/", 
       "2"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"thermalState", "[", 
    RowBox[{"n_", ",", " ", "nbar_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"q", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
         RowBox[{"nbar", ",", " ", "1.*^-12"}], "]"}], "/", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
           RowBox[{"nbar", ",", " ", "1.*^-12"}], "]"}], " ", "+", " ", "1"}],
          ")"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"With", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"w", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"q", "^", 
          RowBox[{"Range", "[", 
           RowBox[{"0", ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"n", " ", "-", " ", "1"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"DiagonalMatrix", "[", 
        RowBox[{"w", "/", 
         RowBox[{"Total", "[", "w", "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[4]:= ",
 CellID->1541450781,ExpressionUUID->"1f908cf3-3c70-d55a-45af-25bdb50abfa0"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Coherent",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " means an eigenstate of the lowering operator: a pure state ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"]},
   "Ket"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5dac66ba-272d-3627-0b54-7fe452d99d0d"],
 " with ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    OverscriptBox[
     StyleBox["a", "TI"], "^"], 
    TemplateBox[{
      StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"]},
     "Ket"]}], "=", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], 
    TemplateBox[{
      StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"]},
     "Ket"]}]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "110914de-bbdd-83a1-4736-8d983e69d18b"],
 ". The check takes any density matrix, gates on purity, and measures the \
eigenstate residual:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1657269721,ExpressionUUID->"76d004f9-29e5-6665-1eef-9da34f904d4f"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"coherentQ", "[", "rho_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"purity", "[", "rho", "]"}], " ", ">", " ", 
     RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", 
      RowBox[{"10", "^", 
       RowBox[{"-", "6"}]}]}]}], " ", "&&", "\n", "   ", 
    RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"a", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"annihilation", "[", 
          RowBox[{"Length", "[", "rho", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", "v"}], 
       "}"}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"v", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Normalize", "[", 
         RowBox[{"First", "@", 
          RowBox[{"Last", "@", 
           RowBox[{"Eigensystem", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"N", "@", "rho"}], ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";",
        "\n", "    ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Norm", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"a", " ", ".", " ", "v"}], " ", "-", " ", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Conjugate", "[", "v", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", "a", " ", ".",
              " ", "v"}], ")"}], " ", "v"}]}], "]"}], " ", "<", " ", 
        RowBox[{"10", "^", 
         RowBox[{"-", "4"}]}]}]}]}], "]"}]}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[5]:= ",
 CellID->1140508347,ExpressionUUID->"2c76c797-c249-79ca-540d-ded0f7fc4b10"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Thermal",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " means diagonal in the number basis with populations falling geometrically \
at a single temperature. The check reads the state's own mean occupation, \
builds the thermal state with that occupation, and measures the distance:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->496109794,ExpressionUUID->"35077f55-9291-6519-633d-771f27244c63"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"thermalQ", "[", "rho_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Norm", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"rho", " ", "-", " ", 
        RowBox[{"DiagonalMatrix", "[", 
         RowBox[{"Diagonal", "[", "rho", "]"}], "]"}]}], ",", 
       " ", "\"\<Frobenius\>\""}], "]"}], " ", "<", " ", 
     RowBox[{"10", "^", 
      RowBox[{"-", "6"}]}]}], " ", "&&", "\n", "   ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"traceDistance", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"N", "@", "rho"}], ",", " ", 
       RowBox[{"thermalState", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Length", "[", "rho", "]"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Re", "@", 
          RowBox[{"Tr", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"numberOp", "[", 
             RowBox[{"Length", "[", "rho", "]"}], "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
            "rho"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], " ", "<", " ", 
     RowBox[{"10", "^", 
      RowBox[{"-", "4"}]}]}]}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[6]:= ",
 CellID->108435171,ExpressionUUID->"4ebf3687-f906-130d-7644-afe0f8b37e57"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Gaussian",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " means fully described by its first and second moments. The check makes \
that literal: read the state's moments, build the displaced squeezed thermal \
state with exactly those moments, and measure the distance. A Gaussian state \
lands on its reconstruction; anything else does not:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->829388421,ExpressionUUID->"65de4a87-3471-cd9f-13e6-63e1bd0597e5"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"gaussianFrom", "[", "rho_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"n", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Length", "[", "rho", "]"}]}], ",", " ", "a", ",", " ", 
       "beta", ",", " ", "da", ",", " ", "m2", ",", " ", "nc", ",", " ", "u", 
       ",", " ", "nbar", ",", " ", "r", ",", " ", "th", ",", " ", "xi"}], 
      "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"a", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"annihilation", "[", "n", "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
      RowBox[{"beta", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Tr", "[", 
        RowBox[{"a", " ", ".", " ", "rho"}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"da", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"a", " ", "-", " ", 
        RowBox[{"beta", " ", 
         RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "n", "]"}]}]}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"m2", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Tr", "[", 
        RowBox[{"da", " ", ".", " ", "da", " ", ".", " ", "rho"}], "]"}]}], ";",
       " ", 
      RowBox[{"nc", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Re", "@", 
        RowBox[{"Tr", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "da", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", "da",
           " ", ".", " ", "rho"}], "]"}]}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"u", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"2", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
         RowBox[{"Max", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"(", 
              RowBox[{"nc", " ", "+", " ", 
               RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}]}], ")"}], "^", "2"}], " ", "-", " ", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "m2", "]"}], "^", "2"}]}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"1", "/", "4"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}]}], ";", " ", 
      RowBox[{"nbar", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"u", " ", "-", " ", "1"}], ")"}], "/", "2"}]}], ";", "\n", 
      "   ", 
      RowBox[{"r", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"If", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "m2", "]"}], " ", "<", " ", 
          RowBox[{"10", "^", 
           RowBox[{"-", "12"}]}]}], ",", " ", "0.", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"ArcTanh", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Min", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "m2", "]"}], "/", 
              RowBox[{"(", 
               RowBox[{"nc", " ", "+", " ", 
                RowBox[{"1", "/", "2"}]}], ")"}]}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", 
              RowBox[{"10", "^", 
               RowBox[{"-", "12"}]}]}]}], "]"}], "]"}], "/", "2"}]}], "]"}]}],
       ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"th", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"If", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Abs", "[", "m2", "]"}], " ", "<", " ", 
          RowBox[{"10", "^", 
           RowBox[{"-", "12"}]}]}], ",", " ", "0.", ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Arg", "[", 
          RowBox[{"-", "m2"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
      RowBox[{"xi", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"r", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
         RowBox[{"I", " ", "th"}], "]"}]}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"With", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"D0", " ", "=", " ", 
           RowBox[{"displacement", "[", 
            RowBox[{"n", ",", " ", "beta"}], "]"}]}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"S0", " ", "=", " ", 
           RowBox[{"squeeze", "[", 
            RowBox[{"n", ",", " ", "xi"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", 
        "    ", 
        RowBox[{"D0", " ", ".", " ", "S0", " ", ".", " ", 
         RowBox[{"thermalState", "[", 
          RowBox[{"n", ",", " ", "nbar"}], "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
         RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "S0", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
         RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "D0", "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}]}], 
    "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"gaussianQ", "[", "rho_", "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"traceDistance", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"N", "@", "rho"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"gaussianFrom", "[", "rho", "]"}]}], "]"}], " ", "<", " ", 
    RowBox[{"10", "^", 
     RowBox[{"-", "3"}]}]}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[7]:= ",
 CellID->203008389,ExpressionUUID->"7bedd9bd-1d84-ddaa-2992-d0e79436a7f0"],

Cell["\<\
The three words are nested, and the nesting is exactly the confusion the \
checks kill: thermal states and coherent states are both Gaussian, they \
overlap only in the vacuum, and the cat is none of the three. Run all three \
checks over five familiar states:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1090263105,ExpressionUUID->"4c37f35a-e1a6-07fe-75cc-eb0790536dc4"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Grid", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"Prepend", "[", "\n", "  ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"With", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"names", " ", "=", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           
           RowBox[{"\"\<vacuum\>\"", ",", 
            " ", "\"\<coherent, \[Alpha] = 2\>\"", ",", 
            " ", "\"\<squeezed vacuum, r = 0.6\>\"", ",", "\n", 
            "      ", "\"\<thermal, mean occupation 1.2\>\"", ",", 
            " ", "\"\<cat, \[Alpha] = 1.5\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",", "\n", "    ", 
         
         RowBox[{"states", " ", "=", " ", 
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"densityMatrix", "[", 
             RowBox[{"coherentState", "[", 
              RowBox[{"30", ",", " ", "0"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"densityMatrix", "[", 
             RowBox[{"coherentState", "[", 
              RowBox[{"30", ",", " ", "2."}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", "\n", 
            "      ", 
            RowBox[{"With", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"{", 
               RowBox[{"S", " ", "=", " ", 
                RowBox[{"squeeze", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"30", ",", " ", "0.6"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
              RowBox[{"S", " ", ".", " ", 
               RowBox[{"densityMatrix", "[", 
                RowBox[{"coherentState", "[", 
                 RowBox[{"30", ",", " ", "0"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
               RowBox[{"ConjugateTranspose", "[", "S", "]"}]}]}], "]"}], ",", 
            "\n", "      ", 
            RowBox[{"thermalState", "[", 
             RowBox[{"30", ",", " ", "1.2"}], "]"}], ",", "\n", "      ", 
            RowBox[{"densityMatrix", "[", 
             RowBox[{"Normalize", "[", 
              RowBox[{
               RowBox[{"coherentState", "[", 
                RowBox[{"30", ",", " ", "1.5"}], "]"}], " ", "+", " ", 
               RowBox[{"coherentState", "[", 
                RowBox[{"30", ",", " ", 
                 RowBox[{"-", "1.5"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}]}], 
        "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{"MapThread", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"#1", ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"gaussianQ", "[", "#2", "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"thermalQ", "[", "#2", "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"coherentQ", "[", "#2", "]"}]}], "}"}], " ", "&"}], ",", 
         " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"names", ",", " ", "states"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",",
      "\n", "  ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<state\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<Gaussian?\>\"", ",", 
       " ", "\"\<thermal?\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<coherent?\>\""}], "}"}]}], 
    "]"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "All"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Alignment", " ", "->", " ", "Left"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[8]:= ",
 CellID->702809756,ExpressionUUID->"02f88238-86c8-66df-3287-2462337d4c25"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[GridBox[{
    {"\<\"state\"\>", "\<\"Gaussian?\"\>", "\<\"thermal?\"\>", "\<\"coherent?\
\"\>"},
    {"\<\"vacuum\"\>", "True", "True", "True"},
    {"\<\"coherent, \[Alpha] = 2\"\>", "True", "False", "True"},
    {"\<\"squeezed vacuum, r = 0.6\"\>", "True", "False", "False"},
    {"\<\"thermal, mean occupation 1.2\"\>", "True", "True", "False"},
    {"\<\"cat, \[Alpha] = 1.5\"\>", "False", "False", "False"}
   },
   AutoDelete->False,
   GridBoxAlignment->{"Columns" -> {{Left}}},
   GridBoxFrame->{"Columns" -> {{True}}, "Rows" -> {{True}}},
   GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
  "Grid"]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[8]= ",
 CellID->392836123,ExpressionUUID->"034d641c-5834-e412-3173-7e4659c6cf78"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
One table, and the boundary sits in plain sight: the vacuum passes all three \
checks, the squeezed vacuum is the separating example (Gaussian, neither \
thermal nor coherent), and the cat fails everything. From here on, an \
assumption saying \"Gaussian\" means the first column and nothing stronger.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->176337227,ExpressionUUID->"52ce4f6a-032d-a48b-02f6-6734b6d90ed1"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Well separated",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " is a statement about the overlap of the two lobes, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{GridBox[{
     {
      TemplateBox[{
        StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], 
        RowBox[{"-", 
          StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"]}]},
       "BraKet"]}
    },
    GridBoxDividers->{"Columns" -> {True, True}, "Rows" -> {}},
    GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {{0.15}}}], "=", 
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
    RowBox[{"-", "2", 
     SuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], "2"]}]]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5bfe104a-50de-a555-0985-8a1461680fbf"],
 " for real ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "134534fb-1061-d656-417a-ada5a115bcbc"],
 ". Compare the closed form with the computed overlap across sizes:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->807053435,ExpressionUUID->"2cd98fd2-34e7-e188-54e6-269cbc93b3d2"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"al", " ", "=", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{"0.5", ",", " ", "1.", ",", " ", "1.5", ",", " ", "2."}], 
      "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Grid", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Prepend", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Transpose", "[", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{"al", ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"N", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"-", "2"}], " ", 
             RowBox[{"al", "^", "2"}]}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", "\n", "     ", 
          RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
             RowBox[{
              RowBox[{"Conjugate", "[", 
               RowBox[{"coherentState", "[", 
                RowBox[{"30", ",", " ", "a"}], "]"}], "]"}], " ", ".", " ", 
              RowBox[{"coherentState", "[", 
               RowBox[{"30", ",", " ", 
                RowBox[{"-", "a"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
            RowBox[{"{", 
             RowBox[{"a", ",", " ", "al"}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}], "]"}], ",",
        "\n", "   ", 
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"\"\<\[Alpha]\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<closed form\>\"", ",", 
         " ", "\"\<computed overlap\>\""}], "}"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "All"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Alignment", " ", "->", " ", "Left"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",\

 CellLabel->"In[9]:= ",
 CellID->832633147,ExpressionUUID->"6e1c99a5-dcef-9c28-1623-100ed49be772"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[GridBox[{
    {"\<\"\[Alpha]\"\>", "\<\"closed form\"\>", "\<\"computed overlap\"\>"},
    {"0.5`", "0.6065306597126334`", "0.6065306597126331`"},
    {"1.`", "0.1353352832366127`", "0.13533528323661265`"},
    {"1.5`", "0.011108996538242306`", "0.011108996538242284`"},
    {"2.`", "0.00033546262790251185`", "0.0003354626279024097`"}
   },
   AutoDelete->False,
   GridBoxAlignment->{"Columns" -> {{Left}}},
   GridBoxFrame->{"Columns" -> {{True}}, "Rows" -> {{True}}},
   GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
  "Grid"]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[9]= ",
 CellID->1403310832,ExpressionUUID->"608e87cc-8fce-afdf-10b5-1e962a78f525"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The overlap dies as the square of the size, so \"well separated\" arrives \
quickly; where the threshold sits is a choice, and the working size below is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], "=", "1.5"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "2aa912c6-4938-1bb7-5a56-8ba068cd699d"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1828793009,ExpressionUUID->"66b4bee0-d247-b105-0e4b-37cde7f3006f"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Coherence",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " is a choice, not a fact: some number must stand for \"how much \
superposition is left,\" and more than one reasonable number exists. This \
part uses the cross-term weight ratio read off the two-lobe expansion of the \
state (defined in the development below); the rival, the trace distance to \
the two-lobe mixture, is computed beside it under ",
 StyleBox["Two numbers for one coherence", "TI"],
 ", so the choice is compared rather than trusted."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1232986364,ExpressionUUID->"337c2d89-644e-5b5e-6103-c4d30dfb29a4"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["No memory",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " means the environment hands nothing back: the loss rate is one constant ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5f7c2741-1c81-ec9b-0503-bf2b9535b6e1"],
 ", and the evolution from any moment depends only on the state at that \
moment. The contrast that defines it lives under ",
 StyleBox["A bath that hands the amplitude back", "TI"],
 ", where the environment is a single mode that returns amplitude before \
losing it."
}], "Text",
 CellID->762269937,ExpressionUUID->"644cc522-c7c4-9b18-0c73-dc8ff276e662"],

Cell["The assumptions", "Subsection",
 CellID->405213039,ExpressionUUID->"2de8c8f9-eaf3-8e90-5b97-e1a28e87d4fa"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["A1, a fact: the bath keeps no memory.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " One constant rate ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "6801f052-da94-0b6f-183e-ea1fdf2159b5"],
 "; the equation is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"], "."], "=", 
   StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], "\[ThinSpace]", "\|01d49f", 
   StyleBox["[",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   OverscriptBox[
    StyleBox["a", "TI"], "^"], 
   StyleBox["]",
    SpanMaxSize->1], 
   StyleBox["\[Rho]", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "0daf8e98-7628-e40b-3b54-27c203c2cf51"],
 ". Turned off under ",
 StyleBox["A bath that hands the amplitude back", "TI"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellID->2118931930,ExpressionUUID->"7b6211f5-475c-1194-2911-88bf72e963fe"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["A2, a fact: the bath is at zero temperature.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " The environment absorbs and never emits; there is no upward channel. \
Turned off under ",
 StyleBox["A warm bath", "TI"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1039057480,ExpressionUUID->"7c8f7bdf-2493-8d8a-24b5-72994d27d7d0"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["A3, a fact, held provisionally: nothing drives the mode.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " No Hamiltonian at all. Turned off under ",
 StyleBox["A drive that rotates the lobes", "TI"],
 ", and the computation there will demote it."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1411198270,ExpressionUUID->"14e8dcaf-74c9-37ba-3c97-d5097d7d9d80"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["A4, a fact about scope: the lobes are well separated.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " The overlap ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SuperscriptBox[
   StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
   RowBox[{"-", "2", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], "2"]}]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "5d5cbd3a-e88d-ee42-0b63-35678939b4a8"],
 " is negligible. Turned off under ",
 StyleBox["Bringing the lobes close", "TI"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1703453532,ExpressionUUID->"3b7fe4cc-5889-7f4e-6904-fd96593c4594"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["A5, numerical: the ladder is cut at a finite level.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Checked under ",
 StyleBox["Raising the cutoff", "TI"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1477609488,ExpressionUUID->"6cb5c01f-62f5-68e0-144a-da5916803aca"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["C1, a choice: coherence means the cross-term weight ratio.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " Compared against the trace-distance rival under ",
 StyleBox["Two numbers for one coherence", "TI"],
 "."
}], "Text",
 CellID->1030824397,ExpressionUUID->"55f417ec-7166-d78d-038b-8eb60010bdd7"],

Cell["From one lobe to the law", "Subsection",
 CellID->100031176,ExpressionUUID->"4b6e5dad-9702-0c1f-7916-54f722b75765"],

Cell["Fix the cutoff, the leak rate, and the pair:", "Text",
 CellID->144223354,ExpressionUUID->"1d359769-845f-cd94-44ca-0f332deb97fe"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"topCat", " ", "=", " ", "30"}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"downCat", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"annihilation", "[", "topCat", "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"blankCat", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"IdentityMatrix", "[", "topCat", "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"\[Gamma]cat", " ", "=", " ", "0.7"}], ";", " ", 
  RowBox[{"\[Alpha]0", " ", "=", " ", "1.5"}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"cat0", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"densityMatrix", "[", 
    RowBox[{"Normalize", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"coherentState", "[", 
       RowBox[{"topCat", ",", " ", "\[Alpha]0"}], "]"}], " ", "+", " ", 
      RowBox[{"coherentState", "[", 
       RowBox[{"topCat", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"-", "\[Alpha]0"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[10]:= ",
 CellID->1443527617,ExpressionUUID->"2055bfee-d4b5-7aa2-506a-36cbdd404888"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Q1.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " A single coherent state under the leak stays coherent and only shrinks, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"]},
    "Ket"], "\[Rule]", 
   TemplateBox[{
     RowBox[{
       StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], 
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
        RowBox[{"-", 
          StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["t", "TI"], "/", "2"}]]}]},
    "Ket"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "64c30c0d-1857-1b13-0cf0-a65799e26679"],
 ". Evolve one lobe by the matrix-exponential route and read its overlap with \
the shrunk coherent state:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->311511756,ExpressionUUID->"46632a09-cc5f-b0ef-6e10-cc52e5eb0235"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"later", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"evolve", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"0", " ", "blankCat"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"{", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "\[Gamma]cat", "]"}], " ", "downCat"}], "}"}], 
        ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"densityMatrix", "[", 
         RowBox[{"coherentState", "[", 
          RowBox[{"topCat", ",", " ", "\[Alpha]0"}], "]"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
        "1.0"}], "]"}]}], ",", "\n", "  ", 
     RowBox[{"target", " ", "=", " ", 
      RowBox[{"coherentState", "[", 
       RowBox[{"topCat", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"\[Alpha]0", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"-", "\[Gamma]cat"}], "/", "2"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}]}], 
    "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Re", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Conjugate", "[", "target", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", "later", " ", ".",
      " ", "target"}], "]"}]}], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[11]:= ",
 CellID->1474733835,ExpressionUUID->"6ea251ed-865f-e03c-1652-48b733ebb306"],

Cell[BoxData["1.0000000000000007`"], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[11]= ",
 CellID->568315932,ExpressionUUID->"25a0bfbe-b1d4-2428-535f-36fbc0668f72"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Overlap one: coherent states are the states this leak preserves. This uses \
A1, A2, and the cutoff A5, and nothing else; no pair exists yet, so A4 and C1 \
are idle.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->377280352,ExpressionUUID->"04786d0e-016a-d127-2c07-8568b01ca00d"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["Q2 and Q3.",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " The exact action of the leak on a coherent dyadic is"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1717363484,ExpressionUUID->"2d15b43a-cd49-5244-5b2a-2e67e4fc20ae"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      SubscriptBox["\[ScriptCapitalE]", 
       StyleBox["t", "TI"]], 
      RowBox[{
       StyleBox["(",
        FontSize->1.2 Inherited], 
       RowBox[{
        TemplateBox[{
          StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"]},
         "Ket"], 
        TemplateBox[{
          StyleBox["\[Beta]", "TI"]},
         "Bra"]}], 
       StyleBox[")",
        FontSize->1.2 Inherited]}]}], "=", 
     RowBox[{
      SuperscriptBox[
       TemplateBox[{
         StyleBox["\[Beta]", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"]},
        "BraKet"], 
       RowBox[{"\[ThinSpace]", 
        RowBox[{"1", "-", 
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
          RowBox[{"-", 
           StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
           StyleBox["t", "TI"]}]]}]}]], 
      StyleBox["|",
       SpanMaxSize->1,
       FontSize->1.2 Inherited], 
      RowBox[{
       StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], 
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
        RowBox[{"-", 
         StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["t", "TI"], "/", "2"}]]}]}]}], 
    StyleBox["\[RightAngleBracket]",
     SpanMaxSize->1,
     FontSize->1.2 Inherited]}], 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["\[LeftAngleBracket]",
     SpanMaxSize->1,
     FontSize->1.2 Inherited], 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{
       StyleBox["\[Beta]", "TI"], 
       SuperscriptBox[
        StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
        RowBox[{"-", 
         StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["t", "TI"], "/", "2"}]]}], 
      StyleBox["|",
       SpanMaxSize->1,
       FontSize->1.2 Inherited]}], ","}]}]}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",
 CellID->1781880651,ExpressionUUID->"2d1ff276-b82a-c3ca-5b24-f43039dc9110"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "so the diagonal lobes of a cat keep their weight while the cross term ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   StyleBox["\[Beta]", "TI"], "=", "-", 
   StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "14fd1512-f616-8834-3c82-8d5f83a0db1e"],
 " is multiplied by the coherence factor"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1536527082,ExpressionUUID->"66c67103-72a1-9427-0efe-696d0755ff0d"],

Cell[BoxData[
 PaneBox[
  RowBox[{GridBox[{
     {
      RowBox[{
       StyleBox["C", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["(",
        SpanMaxSize->1], 
       StyleBox["t", "TI"], 
       StyleBox[")",
        SpanMaxSize->1]}]}
    },
    GridBoxDividers->{"Columns" -> {True, True}, "Rows" -> {}},
    GridBoxSpacings->{"Columns" -> {{0.15}}}], "=", 
   StyleBox["exp",
    FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", "(", 
   RowBox[{"-", "2", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], "2"], "(", 
    RowBox[{"1", "-", 
     SuperscriptBox[
      StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
      RowBox[{"-", 
       StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
       StyleBox["t", "TI"]}]]}], ")"}], ")", "\[TildeTilde]", 
   StyleBox["exp",
    FontSlant->"Plain"], "\[ThinSpace]", "(", 
   RowBox[{"-", "2", 
    SuperscriptBox[
     StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], "2"], 
    StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"], 
    StyleBox["t", "TI"]}], ")", " ", 
   StyleBox[
    RowBox[{"at", "\[NonBreakingSpace]", "short", "\[NonBreakingSpace]", 
     RowBox[{"time", "."}]}],
    FontSlant->"Plain"]}],
  Alignment->Center,
  ImageSize->Full]], "DisplayFormula",
 CellID->1621535814,ExpressionUUID->"48c794f4-84f6-2bfc-78fc-0dbe2c8379c6"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The cross term therefore dies at the rate ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"2", 
   SuperscriptBox[
    StyleBox["\[Alpha]", "TI"], "2"], 
   StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"]}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "58ee7ecb-1370-1005-0896-7795a605636f"],
 ", the separation squared times half the energy rate, while the energy \
itself drains at ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["\[Gamma]", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "11d04a92-cbef-a8a5-47e0-63dfed9bfa8f"],
 ". That closed form is route one for the headline. Route two extracts the \
same number from the master equation with no reference to the formula: expand \
the evolved state on the two shrinking lobes, undo their overlap with a \
two-by-two solve, and read the cross-term weight against the lobe weight. The \
solve is written for a complex cross term so a later, rotated cat can reuse \
it; note the two-by-two matrix turns singular as the overlap approaches one, \
which is A4 casting a numerical shadow:"
}], "Text",
 CellID->1193935837,ExpressionUUID->"7d9821c9-0e61-bc6d-2ba7-b893ab1506b7"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"lobeWeights", "[", 
    RowBox[{"rho_", ",", " ", "va_", ",", " ", "vb_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Module", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"o", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Re", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Conjugate", "[", "va", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", "vb"}], 
         "]"}]}], ",", " ", "m1", ",", " ", "m2", ",", " ", "p", ",", " ", 
       "cr", ",", " ", "ci"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"m1", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"Re", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"Conjugate", "[", "va", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", "rho", " ", ".",
          " ", "va"}], "]"}]}], ";", " ", 
      RowBox[{"m2", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Conjugate", "[", "va", "]"}], " ", ".", " ", "rho", " ", ".",
         " ", "vb"}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"p", ",", " ", "cr"}], "}"}], " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{"LinearSolve", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"1", " ", "+", " ", 
              RowBox[{"o", "^", "2"}]}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"2", " ", "o"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"{", 
            RowBox[{
             RowBox[{"2", " ", "o"}], ",", " ", 
             RowBox[{"1", " ", "+", " ", 
              RowBox[{"o", "^", "2"}]}]}], "}"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
          RowBox[{"m1", ",", " ", 
           RowBox[{"Re", "[", "m2", "]"}]}], "}"}]}], "]"}]}], ";", "\n", 
      "   ", 
      RowBox[{"ci", " ", "=", " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"Im", "[", "m2", "]"}], "/", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", 
          RowBox[{"o", "^", "2"}]}], ")"}]}]}], ";", "\n", "   ", 
      RowBox[{"{", 
       RowBox[{"p", ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"cr", "^", "2"}], " ", "+", " ", 
          RowBox[{"ci", "^", "2"}]}], "]"}]}], "}"}]}]}], "]"}]}], ";"}], "\n", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"catCoherence", "[", 
    RowBox[{"rho_", ",", " ", "lobe_"}], "]"}], " ", ":=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"With", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"va", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"coherentState", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Length", "[", "rho", "]"}], ",", " ", "lobe"}], "]"}]}], ",",
        " ", 
       RowBox[{"vb", " ", "=", " ", 
        RowBox[{"coherentState", "[", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Length", "[", "rho", "]"}], ",", " ", 
          RowBox[{"-", "lobe"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", "\n", "   ", 
     RowBox[{"With", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{"pc", " ", "=", " ", 
         RowBox[{"lobeWeights", "[", 
          RowBox[{"rho", ",", " ", "va", ",", " ", "vb"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",",
        " ", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"pc", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "2", "]"}], "]"}], "/", 
        RowBox[{"pc", "[", 
         RowBox[{"[", "1", "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}]}], 
  ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[12]:= ",
 CellID->105329933,ExpressionUUID->"3181a460-bc62-f1ee-67be-3e4a3514c334"],

Cell["Integrate the master equation once across the window:", "Text",
 CellID->1234416869,ExpressionUUID->"3937e1d4-04c3-e55a-68cc-f89ead77cfa0"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"catRun", " ", "=", " ", 
   RowBox[{"evolveODE", "[", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"0", " ", "blankCat"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"{", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Sqrt", "[", "\[Gamma]cat", "]"}], " ", "downCat"}], "}"}], ",",
      " ", "cat0", ",", " ", "2.5"}], "]"}]}], ";"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[13]:= ",
 CellID->240380995,ExpressionUUID->"6b45e796-37a7-eecc-197a-fed04253b416"],

Cell["\<\
Now the two routes meet. Measure the largest gap between the extracted \
coherence and the closed form over the whole span:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1771870337,ExpressionUUID->"5e187950-8ca2-2ab2-0638-711a25577898"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Max", "@", 
  RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Abs", "[", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"catCoherence", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"catRun", "[", "t", "]"}], ",", " ", 
        RowBox[{"\[Alpha]0", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"-", "\[Gamma]cat"}], " ", 
           RowBox[{"t", "/", "2"}]}], "]"}]}]}], "]"}], " ", "-", "\n", 
      "    ", 
      RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"-", "2"}], " ", 
        RowBox[{"\[Alpha]0", "^", "2"}], " ", 
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", 
          RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"-", "\[Gamma]cat"}], " ", "t"}], "]"}]}], ")"}]}], 
       "]"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"t", ",", " ", "0.", ",", " ", "2.5", ",", " ", "0.25"}], 
     "}"}]}], "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[14]:= ",
 CellID->1476261556,ExpressionUUID->"250a2d7c-9b81-05b0-5309-c5261e346f9a"],

Cell[BoxData["4.6075645832033274`*^-7"], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[14]= ",
 CellID->1373722967,ExpressionUUID->"15a9104d-5625-6af3-4356-8a1763d038d9"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
The gap sits at the solver tolerance: closed form and extraction agree, and \
neither was fitted to the other. This headline uses A1 (the exponential in \
time), A2 (no upward channel), A4 (the two-lobe expansion is well \
conditioned), and A5; the drive assumption A3 has not entered any formula, a \
first hint of its fate.\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1896945989,ExpressionUUID->"58c17d8b-1b7e-6f79-08ff-74d59e0b3243"],

Cell["\<\
Visualize the headline, coherence against energy on one clock:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->653417278,ExpressionUUID->"43821c38-6720-b4f9-71b1-966212da1ec3"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"Plot", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", "2"}], " ", 
       RowBox[{"\[Alpha]0", "^", "2"}], " ", 
       RowBox[{"(", 
        RowBox[{"1", " ", "-", " ", 
         RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
          RowBox[{
           RowBox[{"-", "\[Gamma]cat"}], " ", "t"}], "]"}]}], ")"}]}], "]"}], 
     ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{"Exp", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"-", "\[Gamma]cat"}], " ", "t"}], "]"}]}], "}"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"{", 
    RowBox[{"t", ",", " ", "0", ",", " ", "2.5"}], "}"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"PlotStyle", " ", "->", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"ColorData", "[", 
       RowBox[{"97", ",", " ", "1"}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"Directive", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"ColorData", "[", 
         RowBox[{"97", ",", " ", "2"}], "]"}], ",", " ", "Dashed"}], "]"}]}], 
     "}"}]}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"PlotLegends", " ", "->", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<coherence |C(t)|\>\"", ",", 
      " ", "\"\<energy fraction\>\""}], "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"Frame", " ", "->", " ", "True"}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"GridLines", " ", "->", " ", "Automatic"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{"FrameLabel", " ", "->", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<time\>\"", ",", " ", "\"\<surviving fraction\>\""}], 
     "}"}]}], ",", " ", 
   RowBox[{"PlotRange", " ", "->", " ", "All"}], ",", "\n", " ", 
   RowBox[{
   "PlotLabel", " ", "->", 
    " ", "\"\<the cross term dies long before the light dims\>\""}]}], 
  "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->"In[15]:= ",
 CellID->296020761,ExpressionUUID->"341c54d9-3079-6bba-5c24-4d83410c3980"],

